    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 3rd level, the dragoon can empower his next melee attack with a polearm or spear that inflicts piercing damage to drain the life force from a living foe as a swift action. The dragoon receives a +2 circumstance bonus to this attack and heals himself of 2d6 damage, with the attack bonus and amount of healing dice increasing by 1 for every two dragoon levels attained after 3rd. This effect lasts until the end of the dragoon's turn or until expended by a successful attack.</p>",
